cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SARtrace, please cite this software release."
title: "SARtrace: Evidence-first Sentinel-1 Backscatter Change Screening"
authors:
  - family-names: Jain
    given-names: Prakash Chand
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A local-first SAR change-screening lab with strict GeoTIFF analysis and a
  leakage-aware, model-free OMBRIA Sentinel-1 flood benchmark harness. The OMBRIA
  benchmark operates on 8-bit image intensity values, not calibrated dB.
